== Charging ==
In order for the Tonalztics of Ralos' to [[Multi-hit weapons|hit twice]], it must be charged with [[Sunfire splinter]]s, holding up to 20,000 maximum charges. Each charge requires 1 Sunfire splinter, costing {{NoCoins|{{GEP|Sunfire splinters|1}}|c}} per attack. The total cost to fully charge the weapon with 20,000 splinters is {{NoCoins|{{GEP|Sunfire splinters|20000}}|c}}. Assuming non-stop use, on the rapid attack style, one attack every 3.6 seconds and 1,000 attacks per hour, the weapon costs {{NoCoins|{{GEP|Sunfire splinters|1}}* 1000|c}} per hour to use.

